[[0,289734,0,9,1,8,"2015-07-16T09:55:30","PlayByPlayAnnouncer","",[],"<p>This idea can be either really good, or SRS 2.0 (oh the irony...). The key, IMO, will be in limiting the editorialization by reporters. That's why I am proposing we limit posts to the following 3 elements: the offending Username, the sub where it occurred (or just the suspected sub where it's not particular user), and as much context as possible in the form of text/links/screenshots.</p>\n<p>No commentary, no judgment, no snarky bullshit. Post facts, let the community sort it out.</p>","Proposal: Username, sub, Context","","ReportSRS"],[1,1049150,0,0,0,0,"2015-07-16T15:31:52","gatordontplaythatsht","",[],"<p>That sounds perfect.</p>"],[1,1073486,0,1,0,1,"2015-07-17T02:15:08","RedditRefugee21","",[],"<p>Good plan</p>"]]
